  "description": "NONMIN crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C40 H48 Cl4 Dy4 N4 O14,3(C2 H3 N1),3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.488-3.889 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.78-112.17°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C49H73Cl4Dy4N7O17. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
